&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a 2D Artist to join the Monopoly GO! team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play every day, whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing, and innovating in the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monopoly GO! is our newest casual game and a flagship franchise, enjoyed by millions&amp;nbsp;worldwide. The team is based in Europe and the US and works daily to create captivating new experiences for our players.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every new Monopoly GO! season starts with possibilities: a character that doesn&#39;t exist yet, a world waiting to be imagined, or a reward players haven&#39;t seen before. As a 2D Artist, you&#39;ll help turn those possibilities into the visual ideas that give each season its identity and guide the artists who bring them into the game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Growing as an artist means growing how you work, not just what you can create. You&#39;ll be&amp;nbsp;expected to build fluency with AI and emerging tools alongside strong 2D fundamentals,&amp;nbsp;learning where they accelerate exploration, improve iteration, and help you produce better work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have experienced artists around you to learn from, but plenty of opportunity to develop&amp;nbsp;your own judgment and approach.&amp;nbsp;If you&#39;re looking for more creative challenges, more chances to stretch your skills, and the&amp;nbsp;support to turn strong fundamentals into a broader and more confident craft, you&#39;ll find plenty of room to grow here&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver 2D concepts and production art within Monopoly GO!&#39;s established art style, working closely with a Senior artist for guidance and refinement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI-assisted tools within your 2D workflow, using sound judgment to identify where they improve quality, iteration, or efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and reference material to support idea generation on your assigned briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give clear feedback when asked, and surface blockers early to keep your tasks on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your immediate pod, the broader art team, and narrative/design partners on assigned features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years experience as a 2D/concept artist working in games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated fluency with AI-assisted tools relevant to 2D production, with experience applying them to real production tasks while maintaining quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design whimsical characters, environments, and props according to established art direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong art fundamentals (composition, scale, perspective, rendering, color, form), backed by proficiency in Photoshop and familiarity with 3D modeling and animation principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written, verbal, and team communication skills, with meticulous attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact recruiting@scopely.com. Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;AI Artist (Generalist)&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;to join our Bingo Bash team in Bangalore on a Hybrid basis!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Bingo Bash team is home to&amp;nbsp; bingo, cards, slots&amp;nbsp; and more! Here you will work on a top-grossing F2P game with significant and growing daily revenues, and help create fresh content for our players.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an artist passionate about leveraging AI to enhance creativity while maintaining high-quality, hand-crafted aesthetics. This role involves training AI models, creating game assets and integrating AI-generated content into production pipelines. You will work closely with Artists and Tech Artists to explore, iterate, and refine visual styles while leveraging AI-powered tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Art Model Training &amp;amp; Refinement:&lt;/strong&gt; Train and fine-tune AI art models to generate high-quality, stylized outputs that align with the project&#39;s artistic vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Content Generation Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize Stable Diffusion, Flux, and proprietary or licensed interfaces to generate and enhance visual assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Leadership, Art teams, Tech Art teams, and Production teams to ensure AI-generated assets align with project objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain clear documentation, share feedback with internal and external Artists, and contribute to process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay informed about AI-art advancements and explore new workflows to enhance creative development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in AI art and 2D art within the game industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio demonstrating art fundamentals (composition, color, style consistency)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with generative art tools (Stable Diffusion, ComfyUI, A1111, or equivalents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with tools such as Photoshop, Illustrator (Blender is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of game asset pipelines and optimization for mobile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with dataset curation, tagging, and model training workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative mindset with clear communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to maintain brand/style fidelity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and adaptability to experiment with new creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to 3D modeling tools (Blender, ZBrush)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic knowledge of 3D modeling or animation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mobile game development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Jira and Clickup workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
