&lt;li&gt;Build productive working relationships with partners across disciplines, proactively seeking context and incorporating different perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay aware of changes and priorities across the broader team and adapt your work appropriately as needs evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate Scopely’s tenets in day-to-day work, treating colleagues with fairness, respect, empathy, and compassion.&lt;/li&gt;
