&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Infrastructure as Code (e.g., Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with policy-as-code and governance tooling (e.g., OPA, Sentinel, AWS Config)&lt;/li&gt;
