&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and execute functional, regression, exploratory, and compatibility testing for mobile, web, desktop, and game applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play and evaluate games to identify issues in gameplay, features, UI, performance, and the overall player experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write, maintain, and execute test cases, checklists, and test scenarios under the guidance of QA engineers and leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reproduce, document, and track defects with clear steps, expected and actual results, and relevant screenshots, videos, logs, or other evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
