&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Lead Game Capture Artist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Marketing Creative Services team, Flamed, in our &lt;strong&gt;Barcelona office&lt;/strong&gt; on a hybrid basis. (3 days a week)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the in-house creative agency, Flamed, an International multidisciplinary team. We build thousands of creatives every year to support all Scopely games Marketing needs worldwide. You will primarily work on &lt;strong&gt;MONOPOLY GO!&lt;/strong&gt;, one of the top mobile games on the market, and may also support other IPs in our extensive portfolio as needed..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Game Scene Setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate and utilize diverse Unity game builds to construct and animate dynamic in-game sequences, using in game animations and assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gameplay &amp;amp; Cinematic Capture:&lt;/strong&gt; Stage, shoot, and capture high-end gameplay footage and cinematic sequences tailored for high-performing UA ads, social media, and promotional trailers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Composition &amp;amp; Still Capture:&lt;/strong&gt; Compose and capture high-resolution gameplay stills and 3D model shots for key art and promotional materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cinematography:&lt;/strong&gt; Craft impactful, high-energy scenes by driving dynamic camera work, lighting, action pacing, and visual effects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Post-Processing &amp;amp; Polish:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform initial footage editing, asset retouching, and color adjustments to elevate final deliverable quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Iterative Quality Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain rigorous attention to detail while actively offering and integrating feedback in a constructive team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in gameplay capture, layout, pre-visualization, or 3D environment design within gaming, marketing, or film.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An excellent video reel (Mandatory)&lt;/strong&gt; demonstrating expert-level cinematography, gameplay capture, and scene composition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Unity Proficiency.&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience building complex scenes, staging animations, and managing camera setups within Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unreal Engine knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Must have hands-on experience using Unreal Engine to produce cinematic-quality renders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of &lt;strong&gt;composition, color, and animation&lt;/strong&gt; timing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good sense of &lt;strong&gt;story-telling&lt;/strong&gt; and understanding of &lt;strong&gt;cinematic language&lt;/strong&gt;, camera terminology with the ability to use motion blur, depth of field and other effects, to create realism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video production software including Premiere, and After Effects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work iteratively and communicate effectively across multidisciplinary teams (motion designers, video editors, producers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solver and ability to work well under pressure and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys collaborating with designers, video editors and motion designers to deliver great advertising and marketing creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Excellent written and verbal English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Point:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical art skills (e.g., scripting, shader creation, rigging, tool development) to support capture workflows and optimize assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the mobile games market and up-to-date knowledge of current pop culture trends (i.e. social media, design, movies, TV, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive interest in AI-assisted design tools and their creative applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
