&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mobile gaming, casual games, or live-service environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong gaming mindset and understanding of player behaviour, engagement mechanics, progression, rewards, and LiveOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience testing Slots, Casino, or casino-style games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing or collaborating with external, offshore, or vendor QA teams&lt;/li&gt;
