&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scopely&lt;/strong&gt; is hiring a &lt;strong&gt;People Operations Partner &lt;/strong&gt;to work on a hybrid basis from our Mexico City hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;People Operations Partner&lt;/strong&gt; makes the employee experience run smoothly for our North America employees. You’ll bring operational expertise and a continuous improvement mindset to onboarding, local benefits, global mobility, and everything between. You care about getting the details right, and you’re always looking for a simpler, faster, better way to do things. Compliance is part of how we work, and your focus is delivering accurate, thoughtful, people-first service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Employee Experience and Lifecycle Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own onboarding for new hires and deliver People Operations new hire orientations that make a strong first impression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm all new hires have the legal right to work and have completed required documentation before day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate and up-to-date employee records.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal and external audits by ensuring employee documentation is completed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct employment verifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the People Business Partner (PBP) org and Legal on offboarding to make the exit experience smooth and respectful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to PBPs, managers, and employees, offering clear guidance on local requirements and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Continuous Improvement and Process Excellence&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive ongoing improvements to People Operations processes, reducing manual work, errors, and turnaround time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and analyze JIRA and People Analytics metrics to spot trends, inform decisions, and improve productivity, including through the use of AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain SOPs for core People processes, with clear roles and responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Legal, IT, and HR Tech to refine HR systems and keep them efficient and aligned with data privacy requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Local Benefits Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee and manager questions on local benefits, providing timely and accurate answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with local brokers in Mexico City to administer benefits, resolve issues, and support open enrollment and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring questions and gaps, and turn them into clearer communications, FAQs, and improved processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Global Mobility Support&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Global Mobility cases from start to finish, coordinating with the Global Mobility team, Legal, and external providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with vendors on relocation services and travel visa support, keeping timelines, costs, and deliverables on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep employees informed at each step, so they know what to expect and who to contact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accuracy, Data Integrity and Compliance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure HR processes align with local labor laws and global standards, and flag potential issues early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate new hire data and perform quarterly audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and submit required compliance reports to government agencies on time and accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert on employment regulations, supporting audits and legal reviews as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Policy Development and Communication&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Employee Relations to develop and implement HR policies that reflect our culture and meet legal requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate policy updates clearly to employees and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make sure policies and procedures are easy to find for employees and the People Team.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;People Operating System&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across teams to maintain a People operating system that supports the business and creates a seamless experience for employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in People Operations, HR operations, or HR administration, ideally in a fast-paced, global environment supporting multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Mexican employment law and HR compliance requirements (IMSS, INFONAVIT, SAT, STPS), with the ability to apply it in practice and learn U.S. and Canadian requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of improving processes, whether by streamlining workflows, building templates and SOPs, or using data to find and fix gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail and a commitment to accuracy in employee data, documentation, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A service mindset: you communicate clearly and empathetically, and take ownership of making things easy for employees and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with an HRIS (Workday preferred) and a ticketing tool (JIRA preferred). Comfort with reporting and metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience, operating or improving agentic AI workflows in a business setting. You must be able to design safe workflows, define the agent&#39;s steps, place human approvals at appropriate points, safeguard sensitive data, validate outputs, handle failures, document the workflow and measure accuracy and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills and the ability to prioritize across multiple workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and Spanish, written and verbal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with U.S. and Canadian employment practices is a huge plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering local benefits and working directly with brokers or carriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global mobility, immigration, or relocation processes, including managing external vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with employee data privacy requirements (e.g., LFPDPPP, GDPR).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR certification or a degree in HR, business, law, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
