&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the End to End feature team’s development pipeline and process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure feature development and delivery is timely and of the highest quality&lt;br&gt;Coordinate, prioritize, moderate and control all production activities in the assigned feature team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the pod in implementing and following Agile/Scrum way of working and thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise between cross departments as per project and team’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up effective, concise, clear and efficient communication protocols both inside and outside team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead process improvement initiatives that will aid in improving feature development or overall production pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within mobile game production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt and complete tasks on the fly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in facilitating cross-team discussion, organization and planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication skills; adept at articulating sophisticated business situations to a variety of audiences&lt;/li&gt;
