&lt;li&gt;Steadfast self-motivation and initiative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong passion for making top quality games that players love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience, or an interest, in applying AI and/or automation to improve existing business processes&lt;/li&gt;
