&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for &lt;strong&gt;Senior 2D Marketing Artists&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team based in Bangalore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing, and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the in-house creative agency, Flamed, an International multidisciplinary team. We build thousands of creatives every year to support all Scopely games&#39; marketing needs worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring Senior Marketing Artists with a focus on high-quality visual execution to join our Production Pod in Bangalore. You will be responsible for crafting static visuals (ads, store assets, social media posts) for some of the top mobile games in the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce high-quality marketing assets from briefs and benchmarks, following established pipelines and templates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute AI-generated visuals, refining them through paintovers, compositing, and final layout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with 2D tools like Photoshop and Illustrator to assemble polished visuals with clean lighting, retouching, and compositional balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and work with 3D tools like Blender/Maya to create solid baselines for the artwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in performance-based iteration cycles, delivering updated versions based on KPIs and creative performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in partnership with Lead Artists to deliver top-notch creatives that reflect brand identity and production benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all visuals align with brand guidelines and support the maintenance and application of style guides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other artists and teams in Barcelona and beyond to ensure visual alignment and timely delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain precise tracking and accountability through internal workflow tools and reporting platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasionally participate in brainstorms or creative alignment sessions, when requested&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in marketing or production art roles, ideally in gaming or entertainment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio showcasing execution-heavy marketing art, including AI-generated visuals, and high-quality compositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong 2D design fundamentals to create polished visuals with clean compositions, refined retouching, and strong compositional balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven skills with AI generation tools (Nano Banana, Flux, Midjourney, ChatGPT, Stable Diffusion, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Adobe Photoshop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of visual fundamentals: layout, color, lighting, and storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven and comfortable working independently within fast-paced production timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent communication skills in English (spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable collaborating with stakeholders across international locations and time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with UA or ASO asset production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D production tools knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI art pipelines, prompt writing, and image refinement tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using production tracking systems and collaborative project tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**Please include a portfolio or PDF/links to examples of your work in the application. Applicants need work examples to be considered.**&lt;/p&gt;
