&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Analyst, Ad Monetization&lt;/strong&gt;, to join our &lt;strong&gt;Global Advertising&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Barcelona, Spain,&lt;/strong&gt; on a hybrid basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing, and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people worldwide daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Advertising team oversees our games&#39; overall ads operations, strategy, and product offerings. The team collaborates with our product, sales, marketing, and other teams to help improve campaign strategy, execution, and analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;analyze ad performance and player behavior to identify opportunities for optimization and strategic improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;conduct deep-dive investigations into ad monetization trends and KPIs, turning data into actionable insights that influence product and revenue strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;design, monitor, and interpret A/B tests and experiments to evaluate new ad features or monetization approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;collaborate with Product Managers and Engineers to translate analytical findings into product improvements and innovative ad experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;exhibit sound ad product judgment, advise on industry-standard processes, and present clear, measurable objectives that will lead to achieving our business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build and maintain dashboards that help stakeholders track performance and guide decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;partner with Finance and Product teams to ensure forecast accuracy and data consistency across systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;partner with our Product Development team to build innovative advertising solutions that enhance the ads user experience and engagement rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;communicate results clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders, influencing decision-making through structured storytelling and data-evidence-based recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in data analysis or ad monetization, ideally in the gaming or mobile app ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;solid technical foundation: proficient in SQL and comfortable working with data models and visualization tools (Looker, Tableau, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;understanding how advertising metrics relate to player experience, revenue, and business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with a track record of using data to drive meaningful outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;clear communication skills to translate complex data into actionable insights for diverse stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;understanding of ad tech and monetization mechanics (mediation, programmatic, rewarded video, SSPs/DSPs)&lt;/li&gt;
