&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scopely&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Sr. Director Business Development &lt;/strong&gt;to join our Global Publishing team!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Business Development team is responsible for business negotiations, partner management, and new expansion opportunities with our largest IP partners, new distribution platforms (e.g. storefronts, hardware manufacturers, subscription services, etc.), and digital payment partners (e.g. Stripe, Visa, &lt;a href=&quot;http://checkout.com&quot;&gt;Checkout.com&lt;/a&gt;, etc.) around the world.&amp;nbsp; Through these relationships, the team is responsible for creating and executing a strategy for each partner that drives audience and revenue&amp;nbsp; growth for Scopely’s portfolio of games.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
