&lt;li&gt;Articulate the Scopely vision and how we can most effectively partner together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute on a global business development strategy that connects to our overall distribution strategy and principles.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and negotiate large complex partnerships that grow Scopely’s overall consumer and commercial presence globally.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with internal teams to ensure the needs of the business are being met in a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel domestically and internationally and an appreciation for the way business is conducted in different parts of the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep tabs on industry trends by obsessively analyzing the market, playing all the new releases, and attending industry events and conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
