&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a talented &lt;strong&gt;Senior Motion Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Marketing Creative Services team, Flamed, in our &lt;strong&gt;Barcelona office&lt;/strong&gt;, working on a hybrid basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day, whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Flamed, the in-house creative agency, an international multidisciplinary team. We produce thousands of creatives each year to support the global marketing needs of all Scopely games. This role will involve supporting multiple titles across our portfolio, depending on business needs, including &lt;strong&gt;Pokémon GO&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Monster Hunter Now&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Pikmin Bloom&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver high-quality motion design projects, translating creative briefs into strong visual solutions, from art direction through to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build impactful brand identities for our games and drive top-performing results in collaboration with other creative teams. Stay up to date with current pop culture trends (e.g., social media, design, film, TV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in brainstorming sessions, ideate, and create storyboards and/or animatics to communicate concepts ahead of production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with strong attention to detail in a collaborative, feedback-driven environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in motion graphic design within advertising or entertainment marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong demo reel showcasing expert-level motion design and animation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in industry-standard tools, including &lt;strong&gt;After Effects&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Cinema 4D&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Octane Render&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Premiere&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Photoshop&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video editing, color grading, and sound design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong art direction skills, storytelling ability, and a keen visual sense.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and a passion for creative excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for mobile games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Point:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using &lt;strong&gt;Unreal Engine&lt;/strong&gt; to produce cinematic-quality renders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional knowledge with &lt;strong&gt;Unity&lt;/strong&gt; is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Social Media, Performance Marketing, and User Acquisition creatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive interest in AI-assisted design tools and their creative applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*To be considered for this role, please submit your CV and showreel with your application. A showreel is an essential requirement, and if available, you may also include a portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
