&lt;p&gt;Scopely is seeking a highly motivated &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;to join our Playgami team in Barcelona on a hybrid basis!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to encourage play every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing, and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people worldwide daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Playgami is building the best SaaS gaming platform ever! The team strives to build the world’s best products for game production, operation, and insights. Powering many award-winning, loved-by-millions franchise games over mobile, web, and PC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead work from design through implementation and operation, producing maintainable code, useful documentation, effective tests, and reliable releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for complex features and systems that run world-class games at scale, owning clear trade-offs between player experience, delivery speed, and long-term health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise standards across teams, improving delivery, performance, reliability, scalability, and security through sound design and production feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with colleagues in product, data, design and other disciplines to clarify ambiguous problems, align decisions, manage dependencies, and deliver meaningful outcomes for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers, share knowledge, and help colleagues succeed beyond your immediate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong computer science and engineering fundamentals, including system design, data structures, algorithms and concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Java, C#, or another object-oriented language, including asynchronous and parallel programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of designing, shipping, and operating complex production systems with high-quality, maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead across teams and disciplines through influence, communicate decisions clearly, and work constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product engineering mindset, sound judgment under ambiguity, and a habit of learning and improving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud platforms such as AWS or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with low-latency, high-volume distributed systems or large-scale data technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a modern web framework such as React or Angular.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
